# ⚠⚠ NO GAME FILES. EVER. This repo carries findings, addresses and formats -- never EA's data.
# Master's rule, 2026-09-21: "no gamefiles". The reader is BYO-disc: it runs against a copy the
# user already owns and never ships one.
*.bin
*.cue
*.iso
*.img
*.wad
*.WAD
*.elf
SLES_*
SLUS_*
SCES_*
*.tga
*.TGA
*.ssh
*.mpc
*.MPC
*.irx
*.IRX
*.sdt
*.map
*.RSE
*.rss
*.sam
*.mps
*.aps
# ...and anything extracted from one
extracted/
dump/
*.raw

# Python bytecode
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Build output. ⚠ These were tracked from 2026-09-21 until this commit, because `git add -A` after
# a local build picks them up and nothing here excluded them. A committed DLL also means a `git
# pull` on a machine that has built the same tree fails with "local changes would be overwritten",
# which is how it surfaced.
bin/
obj/
*.dll
*.pdb
*.deps.json
.godot/
